</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Investigate the bootstrap consistency theorem.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Study bootstrap failure for extreme-value estimators and irregular
statistics.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Investigate permutation distributions and compare them with sampling
